# Market data is reproducible from src/data/market_data.py. The per-year Treasury
# files and the FRED series are intermediates and run to thousands of rows; the
# combined curve file is kept because every valuation in the project depends on it.
data/raw/treasury_par_2*.csv
data/raw/fred_*.csv

# data/processed/ and reports/figures/ are deliberately NOT ignored. They are the
# results the report quotes and the figures it embeds, and committing them means the
# repository can be reviewed without first sitting through a twenty-minute model run.

# Figures are built into reports/figures and staged here for typesetting.
paper/figures/

